---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — SpecGrid"
  description="Privacy Policy for SpecGrid, India's technical manufacturer directory."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="doc-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="doc-header">
        <div class="titleblock" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <div>Document<strong>DOC-REF // PRIVACY-2026-08</strong></div>
          <div>Standard<strong>Data Minimization / Privacy First</strong></div>
          <div>Effective<strong>August 2026</strong></div>
          <div>Platform<strong>specgrid.in</strong></div>
        </div>

        <div class="tag" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Privacy &amp; Data Protection</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="doc-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="doc-meta mono">Last updated: August 2026</div>
      </header>

      <div class="doc-content">
        <section class="doc-section">
          <div class="section-tag mono">§ 01 // Collection Scope</div>
          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Directly from you:</strong> your email, name, and any details you submit through an enquiry, claim, or contact form.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Automatically:</strong> basic device and usage data (via privacy-preserving Cloudflare Web Analytics — no cookies, no cross-site tracking today). If cookie-based analytics (PostHog, GA4) are added later, they will only fire after you consent via a cookie banner.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>From public sources:</strong> for draft profiles, company information gathered from public websites and directories (see the <a href="/data-disclaimer" class="doc-link">Data Disclaimer</a>).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="doc-section">
          <div class="section-tag mono">§ 02 // Processing Purpose</div>
          <h2>How we use it</h2>
          <p>
            To route enquiries between buyers and suppliers, operate and improve the directory, and respond to correction or removal requests. We do not sell your data to third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="doc-section">
          <div class="section-tag mono">§ 03 // Third-Party Disclosures</div>
          <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
          <p>
            Infrastructure providers only, to operate the service: Cloudflare (hosting, database, storage). We do not resell or share enquiry data with other suppliers or advertisers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="doc-section">
          <div class="section-tag mono">§ 04 // Data Lifecycle</div>
          <h2>Retention</h2>
          <p>
            Enquiry and account data is kept as long as needed to operate the service, or until you request deletion.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="doc-section contact-panel">
          <div class="section-tag mono">§ 05 // Individual Rights</div>
          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            You can request access, correction, or deletion of your data, or of a company profile describing your business, by emailing:
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px;">
            <a href="mailto:mathi@specgrid.in" class="btn btn-primary">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
                <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
              </svg>
              mathi@specgrid.in
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .doc-page {
    padding: 56px 0 72px;
  }

  .doc-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .doc-meta {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .doc-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .doc-section {
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--green);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .doc-section h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .doc-section p {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .doc-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .doc-section strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .doc-link {
    color: var(--green-deep);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .contact-panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    background: var(--card);
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
</style>
